#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames.rst:9 5b5ad6afe6744852b44da83e03339786
msgid ""
"This section includes details on tested frames to speed up DIY builds of "
"multicopters.  If you are looking for a completely ready-to-use vehicle "
"please see our :ref:`RTF wiki page <common-rtf>`."
msgstr ""
"本章节包含经过测试的机架详情，以加快多旋翼DIY组装进程。如果您正在寻找完全即用的飞行器，请参阅我们的 :ref:`RTF wiki页面 "
"<common-rtf>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames.rst:22 2f98980d27744589b6d31d04d6d566fc
msgid ""
"If you have a tested vehicle of your own that you would like added to this "
"list, please do a `blog post on ardupilot.org "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/c/blog>`__, `reply to this discussion "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/reference-frames>`__ and/or :ref:`create a "
"wiki page directly <common_wiki_editing_guide>`.  Please include a video, a "
"list of parts, firmware version used and a parameter file."
msgstr ""
"如果您有经过测试的飞行器希望加入此列表，请在 `ardupilot.org发布博文 "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/c/blog>`__、`回复此讨论 "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/reference-frames>`__ 和/或 :ref:`直接创建Wiki页面 "
"<common_wiki_editing_guide>`。请附上视频、零件清单、固件版本和参数文件。"
